Your Litware order {{orderNumber}} is on its way
<html><body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #222">
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>Your order <b>{{orderNumber}}</b> has left our warehouse and is on its way with {{carrier}}.</p>
{{#if trackingUrl}}<p><a href="{{trackingUrl}}">Track your parcel</a> ({{trackingNumber}})</p>{{else}}<p>{{trackingNumber}}</p>{{/if}}
<table cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse: collapse">
{{#each lines}}<tr><td>{{Quantity}} x</td><td>{{Description}}</td><td style="color:#888">{{Sku}}</td></tr>
{{/each}}</table>
<p>Thank you for shopping with Litware Outdoor!</p>
</body></html>
